# k.attributes/shards/things-abilities: what 65 common things of the catalog that had no ability can do (132 values; 16 of 148 proposed were wrong by the hand check and are not written): the agent role of k.actions, and abilities inherited down WordNet's hypernyms from the kinds the catalog describes (KR6; the rule in tools/attributes-abilities.mjs)
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (the hypernym chains of the first noun senses, as imported in k.words; the abilities they carry down are the catalog's own: k.attributes, k.animals, k.actions; hand-checked in sources/coverage/abilities-audit.tsv)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/attributes-abilities.mjs

# aphid: a kind of insect (WordNet)
@k.attributes.thing.abilities.aphid k.attributes.thing name=aphid can=crawl can=fly can="fly away" core.source="wordnet 3.1"
# apple: the agent of these actions in k.actions
@k.attributes.thing.abilities.apple k.attributes.thing name=apple can=fall core.source="wordnet 3.1"
